      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables\n    weight_x = 0.30\n    weight_y = 0.70\n    std_x = 0.25\n    std_y = 0.10\n    correlation = 0.80\n\n    # Calculate covariance\n    covariance_xy = correlation * std_x * std_y\n\n    # Calculate portfolio variance and standard deviation\n    portfolio_variance = (\n        (weight_x ** 2 * std_x ** 2)\n        + (weight_y ** 2 * std_y ** 2)\n        + (2 * weight_x * weight_y * covariance_xy)\n    )\n    portfolio_std_dev = portfolio_variance ** 0.5\n\n    # Convert to percentage and round to two decimal places\n    answer = round(portfolio_std_dev * 100, 2)\n\n    # Return answer\n    return answer\n```",
